  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "What's your problem?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You think that you're a God",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You came and fucked my life up when you knew that I was lost",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "What's your problem?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'm crying on the floor",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You made me hate myself just so that I would love you more",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I don't give a fuck about you like I used to",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Back when I really thought I knew you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Back when I'd die not to lose you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Yeah, you knew I didn't have many friends when I met you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Was the new kid trying to impress you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You always loved coming to the rescue",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I should've known when my mom said she don't like you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Should've took that as a sign",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Thought I caught you smiling the night that you saw me cry",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I bet it feeds your ego",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "That I'm low all the time",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "'Cause that shit gets you high",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
